OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'bravest' woman
OL,4,Awho died of 'stab wounds' after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a woman who
OL,7,Fcrashed a car into a wall after
OL,8,Fallegedly being stabbed.
OL,10,FEleanor Barnfield, 47, died in hospital
OL,11,Fafter police were called to the crash
OL,12,Fin Bridgend on Monday, where they found
OL,13,Fshe had "puncture wounds unrelated to
OL,14,Fthe collision", which the BBC
OL,15,Funderstands were sustained in a
OL,16,Fstabbing.
OL,18,FA 61-year-old man from Bridgend has
OL,19,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,20,Fafter a "significant" police operation
OL,21,Fat a retirement housing complex, and
OL,22,Fremains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
