OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'bravest' woman
OL,4,Awho died of 'stab wounds' after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleanor, who worked for housing
OL,7,Fassociation Valleys to Coast which runs
OL,8,Fthe complex, has been described by her
OL,9,Ffamily as the "kindest, most loving,
OL,10,Fbravest person in the world".
